: A Statement is laid on the Table of the House. \n*** \n  \n\nSTATEMENT REFERRED TO IN REPLY TO PARTS (a) TO ( d) OF THE STARRED \nQUESTION NO *153    DUE FOR ANSWER ON 08.03.2016 IN THE LOK SABHA \n \n(a):   The statement showing production and procurement of wheat, rice and \ncoarsegrain for the last two years is at Annexure-I. \n(b):   The Government of India has set a target of 305 Lakh Metric Tonnes for \nprocurement of wheat for Rabi Marketing Season (R MS) 2016-17.  The state-\nwise details of the target set for procurement of wheat for RMS 2016- 17 is at \nAnnexure-II. Further, the Government has finalized the arrangements of \nprocurement of wheat during RMS 2016- 17 in a meeting of State Food \nSecretaries held on 15th February, 2016.  \n(c) & (d):  Yes, Madam. The Government of India has urged the State \nGovernments to open adequate number of procurement centres. The issue has \nbeen discussed in State Food Secretaries meeting held on 15.02.2016 and \nthey have chalked out detailed action plan for the St ate for procurement of \nwheat during the ensuing wheat marketing season RMS 2016- 17. The list of \nprocurement centres to be opened for RMS 2016- 17 is already mentioned \nAnnexure II. \n*** \n   \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n  \n\nANNEXURE-I \nANNEXURE REFERRED TO IN REPLY TO PART (a) OF THE STARRED \nQUESTION NO *153    DUE FOR ANSWER ON 08.03.2016 IN THE LOK SABHA \n \nProduction and Procurement of Wheat \n(figures in LMT) \nRMS  2014-15 RMS 2015-16 \nProduction  Procurement Production*  Procurement \n958.49 280.23 865.30 280.88 \n*As per the final Advance estimates of Ministry of Agriculture dated 15th February, 2016. \n \nProduction / Procurement of Rice in Major Producing states \n(as on 02-03-2016) \nKMS 2013-14 KMS 2014-15 KMS 2015-16** \nProduction  Procurement Production*  Procurement Production # Procurement** \n1066.45 318.45 1054.80 320.40 1036.1 284.12 \n* As per the final Advance estimates of Ministry of Agriculture 15th February, 